# Offline frontend (Phase 7 — future)

**Do not implement this now.** The Service Worker + IndexedDB catalogue was built once and **deleted**. Staff consoles (`/manage/items/`, `/manage/catalog/`, `/manage/purchase-orders/`, `/manage/goods-receipts/`) are online-only.

There is no `db.js`, `product_list.js`, `register_sw.js`, `service_worker.js`, or `GET /api/products/` in the tree today.

When Phase 7 re-adds offline catalogue (after Phase 5 branches):

## Responsibilities (do not merge)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `db.js` | IndexedDB open, save, read catalogue |
| `product_list.js` | Fetch API, fallback to cache, display table |
| `register_sw.js` | Service Worker registration |
| `service_worker.js` (template) | Cache app shell only — not API responses |

## Rules

- Service Worker served from `/service-worker.js` (root scope)
- Do not cache `/api/` in the Service Worker — API failure triggers IndexedDB fallback
- Bump `CACHE_NAME` version when app shell files change
- Include all shell scripts in `APP_SHELL` (including `register_sw.js`)
- IndexedDB stores downloaded catalogue only — not user-created products
- PostgreSQL remains the source of truth
